  sim              show overrides
  sim tpo 55       inject TPO °C (desk loop proof)
  sim tpu 30       inject TPU °C
  sim clear        use real NTCs again
  comms [on|off]   ESP-NOW client (DN003); 'comms' = status
  ident T I        provision node_type/id (NVS)
  tel <sec>        telemetry capture period (default 15)
  ring <n>         resize FIFO ring EMPTY (bench decimation)
  hel <ch> [n]     bench: HELLO burst on fixed channel
  prog / st / scan / enc / h
